---
title: Preview front door · stable session origin, exact candidate route
---
sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant page as Preview tab
  participant sdk as Embedded SDK
  participant door as Vercel front door
  participant cp as Control plane · route record
  participant port as Sandbox product port

  Note over page,sdk: Own session origin under<br/>preview.utrace.dev.
  cp->>cp: atomically commit ready revision
  Note over cp: Candidate readiness: exact build + dataset,<br/>every gating readiness probe passed.
  loop Each request
    page->>door: HTTPS · uTrace-issued session access
    door->>cp: authorize route for host
    cp-->>door: current allocation / version · revision + expiry
    alt Valid identity and current route
      door->>port: scoped upstream · signed route claim + entry token
      Note over port: Middleware checks claim + token.<br/>Public port URL, never shown.
      port-->>door: product response
      door-->>page: response · no-store
    else Bare URL or stale route
      door-->>page: neutral interstitial · fail closed
    end
  end
  sdk->>door: same-origin activation
  door->>cp: relay
  cp-->>door: signed attestation · session + runtime + revision
  door-->>sdk: signed document proof
